{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"形式伴随"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"形式伴随"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>设有函子 $F\\colon \\mathcal C \\to\\mathcal D$,</p>\n<ul>\n<li>其<strong>形式左伴随</strong>是函子 $\\mathcal D \\to \\mathsf{Fun}(\\mathcal C,\\mathsf{Ani})^{\\mathrm{op}}$,\n$$\r\nd\\mapsto \\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(d,F(-)).\r\n$$</li>\n<li>其<strong>形式右伴随</strong>是函子 $\\mathcal D \\to \\mathsf{Fun}(\\mathcal C^{\\mathrm{op}},\\mathsf{Ani})$,\n$$\r\nd\\mapsto \\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(F(-),d).\r\n$$</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"∞-意象","text":"$\\infty$-意象"}},{"Plain":" $\\pi\\colon \\mathcal X\\to\\mathsf{Ani}$ 的"},{"Local":{"url":"∞-意象的形","text":"形"}},{"Plain":"是"},{"Local":{"url":"常值层","text":"常值层"}},{"Plain":"函子 $\\pi^*\\colon \\mathsf{Ani} \\to \\mathcal X$ 的形式左伴随 $\\pi_!\\colon \\mathcal X\\to\\mathsf{Fun}(\\mathsf{Ani},\\mathsf{Ani})$ 在 $1\\in\\mathcal X$ 上的取值.</p>\n"}]}}